{"questions":[{"id":"cns_p031_q1","topicId":"cns_p031","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"小鸟的家通常叫什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"鸟巢"},{"key":"B","text":"蜂巢"},{"key":"C","text":"洞穴"},{"key":"D","text":"蚁穴"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"鸟用树枝、草等搭鸟巢。","verify":"\"鸟巢\""},{"id":"cns_p031_q2","topicId":"cns_p031","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"蜜蜂的家叫什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"鸟窝"},{"key":"B","text":"蜂巢"},{"key":"C","text":"树洞"},{"key":"D","text":"贝壳"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"蜜蜂住在由一个个六边形小格组成的蜂巢里。","verify":"\"蜂巢\""},{"id":"cns_p031_q3","topicId":"cns_p031","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"动物的家对动物有什么用？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"只是为了好看"},{"key":"B","text":"用来装玩具"},{"key":"C","text":"遮风挡雨、躲避敌人、养育后代"},{"key":"D","text":"没有用"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"家能保护动物和它们的幼崽。","verify":"\"遮风挡雨、躲避敌人、养育后代\""},{"id":"cns_p031_q4","topicId":"cns_p031","difficulty":"challenge","type":"choice","prompt":"蜂巢的小格子是什么形状？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"圆形"},{"key":"B","text":"三角形"},{"key":"C","text":"正方形"},{"key":"D","text":"六边形"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"蜂巢由许多六边形小格组成，既结实又省材料。","verify":"\"六边形\""},{"id":"cns_p032_q1","topicId":"cns_p032","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"房子上能挡雨的部分是哪里？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"屋顶"},{"key":"B","text":"窗户"},{"key":"C","text":"地板"},{"key":"D","text":"门把手"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"屋顶在最上面，能挡雨挡雪。","verify":"\"屋顶\""},{"id":"cns_p032_q2","topicId":"cns_p032","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"窗户的主要作用是什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"挡住所有光"},{"key":"B","text":"通风和采光"},{"key":"C","text":"只为了装饰"},{"key":"D","text":"用来走路"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"窗户让空气和阳光进入房间。","verify":"\"通风和采光\""},{"id":"cns_p032_q3","topicId":"cns_p032","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"房子的墙有什么作用？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"让屋子漏雨"},{"key":"B","text":"只是为了画画"},{"key":"C","text":"支撑屋顶、隔开房间"},{"key":"D","text":"让声音更大"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"墙能承重、分隔空间、挡风。","verify":"\"支撑屋顶、隔开房间\""},{"id":"cns_p032_q4","topicId":"cns_p032","difficulty":"challenge","type":"choice","prompt":"多雨的地方，很多房子屋顶做成斜的，主要是为什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"为了晒被子"},{"key":"B","text":"为了让人站在上面"},{"key":"C","text":"为了更省钱"},{"key":"D","text":"让雨水快快流下去"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"斜屋顶不积水，雨水能顺坡流走。","verify":"\"让雨水快快流下去\""},{"id":"cns_p033_q1","topicId":"cns_p033","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"菜刀的刀刃通常用什么材料做？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"钢铁"},{"key":"B","text":"塑料"},{"key":"C","text":"纸"},{"key":"D","text":"布"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"钢铁硬，能做锋利的刀刃。","verify":"\"钢铁\""},{"id":"cns_p033_q2","topicId":"cns_p033","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"下面哪一样适合用来做窗帘？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"铁板"},{"key":"B","text":"布"},{"key":"C","text":"砖头"},{"key":"D","text":"玻璃"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"布柔软、能挡光、可折叠。","verify":"\"布\""},{"id":"cns_p033_q3","topicId":"cns_p033","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"锅柄常用木头或塑料包着，主要是因为？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"它们更重"},{"key":"B","text":"它们更亮"},{"key":"C","text":"它们不容易烫手"},{"key":"D","text":"它们会导电"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"木头、塑料传热慢，拿着不烫手。","verify":"\"它们不容易烫手\""},{"id":"cns_p033_q4","topicId":"cns_p033","difficulty":"challenge","type":"choice","prompt":"想做一个能看到窗外又能挡风的窗户，应选哪种材料？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"木板"},{"key":"B","text":"厚布"},{"key":"C","text":"铁皮"},{"key":"D","text":"透明玻璃"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"玻璃透明能透光，又能挡风。","verify":"\"透明玻璃\""},{"id":"cns_p034_q1","topicId":"cns_p034","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"设计小房子时，第一步应该做什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"想清楚房子要满足哪些要求"},{"key":"B","text":"马上开始剪纸"},{"key":"C","text":"先涂颜色"},{"key":"D","text":"先展示给大家"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"先明确要求，再画图、选材料。","verify":"\"想清楚房子要满足哪些要求\""},{"id":"cns_p034_q2","topicId":"cns_p034","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"画设计图有什么用？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"只是为了好看"},{"key":"B","text":"让大家按图制作，少走弯路"},{"key":"C","text":"代替制作"},{"key":"D","text":"不需要设计图"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"设计图把想法画清楚，方便制作。","verify":"\"让大家按图制作，少走弯路\""},{"id":"cns_p034_q3","topicId":"cns_p034","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"小房子要能站得稳，墙最好用哪种材料？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"薄面巾纸"},{"key":"B","text":"棉花"},{"key":"C","text":"硬纸板"},{"key":"D","text":"保鲜膜"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"硬纸板较硬，能立起来。","verify":"\"硬纸板\""},{"id":"cns_p034_q4","topicId":"cns_p034","difficulty":"challenge","type":"choice","prompt":"设计图上画了窗户，做好后却没有窗户，应该怎么办？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"不管它"},{"key":"B","text":"把设计图撕掉"},{"key":"C","text":"改成画一个窗户贴上就算"},{"key":"D","text":"对照设计图补做窗户"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"制作要按设计图来，漏了要补上。","verify":"\"对照设计图补做窗户\""},{"id":"cns_p035_q1","topicId":"cns_p035","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"建造小房子时，使用剪刀要注意什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"刀口不对着人"},{"key":"B","text":"拿着剪刀跑"},{"key":"C","text":"用剪刀玩耍"},{"key":"D","text":"把剪刀扔给同学"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"安全使用工具，刀口不对人。","verify":"\"刀口不对着人\""},{"id":"cns_p035_q2","topicId":"cns_p035","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"小组建造小房子时，最好的做法是？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"一个人全做"},{"key":"B","text":"分工合作"},{"key":"C","text":"谁也不管"},{"key":"D","text":"抢材料"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"分工合作效率高。","verify":"\"分工合作\""},{"id":"cns_p035_q3","topicId":"cns_p035","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"小房子的墙一放上屋顶就倒了，可以怎样改进？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"把屋顶做得更重"},{"key":"B","text":"去掉一面墙"},{"key":"C","text":"在墙角加三角形支撑"},{"key":"D","text":"不放屋顶"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"三角形结构稳固，能让墙更牢。","verify":"\"在墙角加三角形支撑\""},{"id":"cns_p035_q4","topicId":"cns_p035","difficulty":"challenge","type":"choice","prompt":"用胶带把两张纸板拼成直角墙角，下面哪种做法更牢？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"只贴一小点"},{"key":"B","text":"不贴胶带直接靠"},{"key":"C","text":"用水粘"},{"key":"D","text":"里外两面都贴上胶带"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"两面都贴，接口更牢固。","verify":"\"里外两面都贴上胶带\""},{"id":"cns_p036_q1","topicId":"cns_p036","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"展示小房子时，应该介绍什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"设计想法、材料和特点"},{"key":"B","text":"同学的缺点"},{"key":"C","text":"自己的零花钱"},{"key":"D","text":"天气"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"介绍设计、材料、特点，让大家了解作品。","verify":"\"设计想法、材料和特点\""},{"id":"cns_p036_q2","topicId":"cns_p036","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"评价别人的小房子，应该怎样说？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"只说不好"},{"key":"B","text":"先说优点，再提改进建议"},{"key":"C","text":"什么都不说"},{"key":"D","text":"笑话别人"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"评价要友好、具体。","verify":"\"先说优点，再提改进建议\""},{"id":"cns_p036_q3","topicId":"cns_p036","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"一座小房子被风扇一吹就倒，说明它在哪方面需要改进？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"颜色"},{"key":"B","text":"名字"},{"key":"C","text":"稳固程度"},{"key":"D","text":"价钱"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"被吹倒说明不够稳，需要加固。","verify":"\"稳固程度\""},{"id":"cns_p036_q4","topicId":"cns_p036","difficulty":"challenge","type":"choice","prompt":"展示会后，小组最应该做什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"把房子扔掉"},{"key":"B","text":"不再理会"},{"key":"C","text":"只拍照"},{"key":"D","text":"根据建议改进自己的小房子"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"听取意见并改进是工程的一部分。","verify":"\"根据建议改进自己的小房子\""},{"id":"cns_p037_q1","topicId":"cns_p037","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"下面哪种形状的框架最不容易变形？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"三角形"},{"key":"B","text":"正方形"},{"key":"C","text":"长方形"},{"key":"D","text":"圆形"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"三角形结构稳定，不易变形。","verify":"\"三角形\""},{"id":"cns_p037_q2","topicId":"cns_p037","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"铁架桥、电线塔上常看到哪种结构？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"圆形"},{"key":"B","text":"三角形"},{"key":"C","text":"五边形"},{"key":"D","text":"心形"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"三角形结构稳固，常用于建筑和支架。","verify":"\"三角形\""},{"id":"cns_p037_q3","topicId":"cns_p037","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"用吸管做的正方形框架一推就歪，怎样最简单地让它变牢？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"再涂一层颜色"},{"key":"B","text":"换一种颜色的吸管"},{"key":"C","text":"加一根对角线变成两个三角形"},{"key":"D","text":"把它放在桌上"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"加对角线后形成三角形，就不易变形。","verify":"\"加一根对角线变成两个三角形\""},{"id":"cns_p037_q4","topicId":"cns_p037","difficulty":"challenge","type":"choice","prompt":"搭纸塔时，底部宽、上部窄的塔为什么更稳？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"它更好看"},{"key":"B","text":"它用的纸更少"},{"key":"C","text":"它更高"},{"key":"D","text":"底面大，上面轻，不容易倒"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"底面大、上轻下重的结构更稳。","verify":"\"底面大，上面轻，不容易倒\""},{"id":"cns_p038_q1","topicId":"cns_p038","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"下面哪一样不是地球上自然就有的？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"电视机"},{"key":"B","text":"空气"},{"key":"C","text":"水"},{"key":"D","text":"岩石"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"电视机是人造的。","verify":"\"电视机\""},{"id":"cns_p038_q2","topicId":"cns_p038","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"下面哪一组都是地球上的生物？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"石头和水"},{"key":"B","text":"大树和小鸟"},{"key":"C","text":"空气和土壤"},{"key":"D","text":"白云和沙子"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"大树、小鸟有生命，是生物。","verify":"\"大树和小鸟\""},{"id":"cns_p038_q3","topicId":"cns_p038","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"植物生长需要地球上的哪些东西？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"只要阳光"},{"key":"B","text":"只要石头"},{"key":"C","text":"阳光、水、空气和土壤"},{"key":"D","text":"只要电"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"植物生长需要阳光、水、空气和土壤。","verify":"\"阳光、水、空气和土壤\""},{"id":"cns_p038_q4","topicId":"cns_p038","difficulty":"challenge","type":"choice","prompt":"为什么说地球是我们共同的家园？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"地球上只有人"},{"key":"B","text":"地球是人造的"},{"key":"C","text":"地球上没有水"},{"key":"D","text":"人和动植物都依靠地球上的水、空气等生活"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"地球提供生物生存需要的条件。","verify":"\"人和动植物都依靠地球上的水、空气等生活\""},{"id":"cns_p039_q1","topicId":"cns_p039","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"校园里的下面哪一样是自然物？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"大树"},{"key":"B","text":"篮球架"},{"key":"C","text":"教学楼"},{"key":"D","text":"课桌"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"大树是自然生长的。","verify":"\"大树\""},{"id":"cns_p039_q2","topicId":"cns_p039","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"校园里的下面哪一样是人造物？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"小草"},{"key":"B","text":"旗杆"},{"key":"C","text":"蚂蚁"},{"key":"D","text":"泥土"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"旗杆是人做的。","verify":"\"旗杆\""},{"id":"cns_p039_q3","topicId":"cns_p039","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"画校园地图时，最重要的是什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"画得越花越好"},{"key":"B","text":"只画自己的教室"},{"key":"C","text":"把建筑的位置关系画对"},{"key":"D","text":"画上天上的云"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"地图要表示出各处的位置关系。","verify":"\"把建筑的位置关系画对\""},{"id":"cns_p039_q4","topicId":"cns_p039","difficulty":"challenge","type":"choice","prompt":"校园地图上，花坛画在教学楼的东边，实际就该在教学楼的哪边？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"西边"},{"key":"B","text":"北边"},{"key":"C","text":"南边"},{"key":"D","text":"东边"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"地图和实际的方位应该一致。","verify":"\"东边\""},{"id":"cns_p040_q1","topicId":"cns_p040","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"空气是什么颜色的？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"无色透明"},{"key":"B","text":"白色"},{"key":"C","text":"蓝色"},{"key":"D","text":"灰色"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"空气看不见，无色透明。","verify":"\"无色透明\""},{"id":"cns_p040_q2","topicId":"cns_p040","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"空瓶子里有没有空气？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"没有"},{"key":"B","text":"有"},{"key":"C","text":"只有水"},{"key":"D","text":"只有灰尘"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"看起来空的瓶子里其实充满了空气。","verify":"\"有\""},{"id":"cns_p040_q3","topicId":"cns_p040","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"下面哪种现象说明空气在流动？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"石头静止不动"},{"key":"B","text":"水结成冰"},{"key":"C","text":"树叶被风吹动"},{"key":"D","text":"灯亮了"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"流动的空气就是风。","verify":"\"树叶被风吹动\""},{"id":"cns_p040_q4","topicId":"cns_p040","difficulty":"challenge","type":"choice","prompt":"把一个空杯子倒扣着压进水里，杯里的纸团没有湿，为什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"纸团防水"},{"key":"B","text":"水太冷了"},{"key":"C","text":"杯子有魔法"},{"key":"D","text":"杯里的空气占据了空间，水进不去"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"空气占据空间，挡住了水。","verify":"\"杯里的空气占据了空间，水进不去\""},{"id":"cns_p041_q1","topicId":"cns_p041","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"天空中没有云或云很少，阳光明亮，这是什么天气？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"晴天"},{"key":"B","text":"阴天"},{"key":"C","text":"雨天"},{"key":"D","text":"雪天"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"云很少、太阳明亮是晴天。","verify":"\"晴天\""},{"id":"cns_p041_q2","topicId":"cns_p041","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"云很多，看不到太阳，但没有下雨，是什么天气？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"晴天"},{"key":"B","text":"阴天"},{"key":"C","text":"雨天"},{"key":"D","text":"雪天"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"云层厚、不下雨是阴天。","verify":"\"阴天\""},{"id":"cns_p041_q3","topicId":"cns_p041","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"下雨天出门应该带什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"太阳镜"},{"key":"B","text":"扇子"},{"key":"C","text":"雨伞或雨衣"},{"key":"D","text":"游泳圈"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"雨具能挡雨。","verify":"\"雨伞或雨衣\""},{"id":"cns_p041_q4","topicId":"cns_p041","difficulty":"challenge","type":"choice","prompt":"天气记录表上连续三天画了雪花符号，这三天最可能是什么季节？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"夏季"},{"key":"B","text":"春季"},{"key":"C","text":"秋季"},{"key":"D","text":"冬季"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"下雪多发生在寒冷的冬季。","verify":"\"冬季\""},{"id":"cns_p042_q1","topicId":"cns_p042","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"一年有几个季节？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"四个"},{"key":"B","text":"两个"},{"key":"C","text":"三个"},{"key":"D","text":"十二个"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"一年有春、夏、秋、冬四个季节。","verify":"\"四个\""},{"id":"cns_p042_q2","topicId":"cns_p042","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"哪个季节天气最热？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"春季"},{"key":"B","text":"夏季"},{"key":"C","text":"秋季"},{"key":"D","text":"冬季"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"夏季气温最高。","verify":"\"夏季\""},{"id":"cns_p042_q3","topicId":"cns_p042","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"大雁南飞、树叶变黄，通常是哪个季节？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"春季"},{"key":"B","text":"夏季"},{"key":"C","text":"秋季"},{"key":"D","text":"冬季"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"秋天树叶变黄，很多候鸟飞往南方。","verify":"\"秋季\""},{"id":"cns_p042_q4","topicId":"cns_p042","difficulty":"challenge","type":"choice","prompt":"四季的顺序是哪一种？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"春、秋、夏、冬"},{"key":"B","text":"夏、春、冬、秋"},{"key":"C","text":"冬、夏、春、秋"},{"key":"D","text":"春、夏、秋、冬"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"春天过后是夏天，然后是秋天、冬天，再回到春天。","verify":"\"春、夏、秋、冬\""},{"id":"cns_p043_q1","topicId":"cns_p043","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"早上，太阳从哪个方向升起？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"东方"},{"key":"B","text":"西方"},{"key":"C","text":"南方"},{"key":"D","text":"北方"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"太阳东升西落。","verify":"\"东方\""},{"id":"cns_p043_q2","topicId":"cns_p043","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"傍晚，太阳在哪个方向落下？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"东方"},{"key":"B","text":"西方"},{"key":"C","text":"南方"},{"key":"D","text":"北方"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"太阳从西边落下。","verify":"\"西方\""},{"id":"cns_p043_q3","topicId":"cns_p043","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"白天为什么是亮的？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"路灯亮了"},{"key":"B","text":"月亮发光"},{"key":"C","text":"有太阳光照着"},{"key":"D","text":"星星很多"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"白天的光主要来自太阳。","verify":"\"有太阳光照着\""},{"id":"cns_p043_q4","topicId":"cns_p043","difficulty":"challenge","type":"choice","prompt":"中午站在操场上，背对太阳，影子在哪边？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"在自己的背后"},{"key":"B","text":"在太阳那边"},{"key":"C","text":"没有影子"},{"key":"D","text":"在自己的前面"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"影子在背光的一侧，背对太阳时影子在前面。","verify":"\"在自己的前面\""},{"id":"cns_p044_q1","topicId":"cns_p044","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"我们常在什么时候看到月亮？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"夜晚"},{"key":"B","text":"只在中午"},{"key":"C","text":"从来看不到"},{"key":"D","text":"只在下雨时"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"月亮常在夜晚出现，有时白天也能看到。","verify":"\"夜晚\""},{"id":"cns_p044_q2","topicId":"cns_p044","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"月亮本身会发光吗？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"会，像灯一样"},{"key":"B","text":"不会，它反射太阳光"},{"key":"C","text":"会，像太阳一样"},{"key":"D","text":"只在冬天发光"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"月亮本身不发光，我们看到的是它反射的太阳光。","verify":"\"不会，它反射太阳光\""},{"id":"cns_p044_q3","topicId":"cns_p044","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"又圆又亮的月亮叫什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"新月"},{"key":"B","text":"月牙"},{"key":"C","text":"满月"},{"key":"D","text":"半月"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"月亮最圆时叫满月。","verify":"\"满月\""},{"id":"cns_p044_q4","topicId":"cns_p044","difficulty":"challenge","type":"choice","prompt":"连续观察一个月，月亮的形状会怎样？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"一直是圆的"},{"key":"B","text":"一直是弯的"},{"key":"C","text":"每天一模一样"},{"key":"D","text":"从弯到圆，再从圆到弯，不断变化"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"月相有规律地变化，大约一个月一次。","verify":"\"从弯到圆，再从圆到弯，不断变化\""},{"id":"cns_p045_q1","topicId":"cns_p045","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"记录天气时，太阳符号表示什么天气？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"晴天"},{"key":"B","text":"雨天"},{"key":"C","text":"阴天"},{"key":"D","text":"雪天"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"太阳符号代表晴天。","verify":"\"晴天\""},{"id":"cns_p045_q2","topicId":"cns_p045","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"要知道一个月里晴天多还是雨天多，应该怎么做？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"只记一天"},{"key":"B","text":"每天记录，月底数一数"},{"key":"C","text":"随便猜"},{"key":"D","text":"只看第一天"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"坚持记录再统计，就能比较。","verify":"\"每天记录，月底数一数\""},{"id":"cns_p045_q3","topicId":"cns_p045","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"小明的天气日历上，15 天是晴，10 天是雨，5 天是阴，哪种天气最多？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"雨"},{"key":"B","text":"阴"},{"key":"C","text":"晴"},{"key":"D","text":"一样多"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"15 比 10 和 5 都多。","verify":"\"晴\""},{"id":"cns_p045_q4","topicId":"cns_p045","difficulty":"challenge","type":"choice","prompt":"为什么天气要每天在差不多的时间记录？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"老师喜欢"},{"key":"B","text":"记录本会变好看"},{"key":"C","text":"天气只有那时才有"},{"key":"D","text":"这样比较才公平"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"固定时间观察，结果更便于比较。","verify":"\"这样比较才公平\""},{"id":"cns_p031_q5","topicId":"cns_p031","source":"textbook","type":"short","prompt":"地球家园除了人、动物和植物，还有土壤、岩石和水等。","answer":"对","accept":["正确","√","T","true","是"],"difficulty":"basic","explanation":"地球家园不仅包括生物，也包括非生物环境。","verify":"对"},{"id":"cns_p031_q6","topicId":"cns_p031","source":"textbook","type":"choice","prompt":"当天空布满厚厚的黑云，但还没有下雨时，这种天气是：","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"晴天"},{"key":"B","text":"阴天"},{"key":"C","text":"暴雨"},{"key":"D","text":"雪天"}],"answer":"B","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"阴天的特征是云层厚且密，挡住了阳光。","verify":"\"阴天\""},{"id":"cns_p031_q7","topicId":"cns_p031","source":"textbook","type":"choice","prompt":"下列天气中，最适合在户外晾晒衣服的是：","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"雷雨"},{"key":"B","text":"大雾"},{"key":"C","text":"晴天"},{"key":"D","text":"大风"}],"answer":"C","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"晴天阳光充足，气温适宜，利于水分蒸发。","verify":"\"晴天\""},{"id":"cns_p031_q8","topicId":"cns_p031","source":"textbook","type":"short","prompt":"我们观察到的月球明亮部分的各种形状叫做（___）。","answer":"月相","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"月相是地球上看到的月球被太阳照亮的部分。","verify":"月相"},{"id":"cns_p031_q9","topicId":"cns_p031","source":"textbook","type":"choice","prompt":"在土壤里挖小坑，最可能发现的是：","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"云朵"},{"key":"B","text":"小鱼"},{"key":"C","text":"月亮"},{"key":"D","text":"蚯蚓"}],"answer":"D","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"蚯蚓生活在潮湿、疏松的土壤中。","verify":"\"蚯蚓\""},{"id":"cns_p031_q10","topicId":"cns_p031","source":"textbook","type":"choice","prompt":"当我们面对太阳升起的方向，左手指向的是：","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"北方"},{"key":"B","text":"东方"},{"key":"C","text":"西方"},{"key":"D","text":"南方"}],"answer":"A","difficulty":"standard","explanation":"面东背西，左北右南。","verify":"\"北方\""},{"id":"cns_p031_q11","topicId":"cns_p031","source":"textbook","type":"numeric","prompt":"每天太阳升起、落下，我们的方位一共有（___）个基本方向。","answer":"4","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"即东、南、西、北。","verify":"4"},{"id":"cns_p032_q5","topicId":"cns_p032","source":"textbook","type":"short","prompt":"土壤里不仅生活着小动物，还生活着许多植物。","answer":"对","accept":["正确","√","T","true","是"],"difficulty":"basic","explanation":"土壤为多种动植物提供了生存空间和养分。","verify":"对"},{"id":"cns_p032_q6","topicId":"cns_p032","source":"textbook","type":"choice","prompt":"大雁南飞、树叶变黄发生在什么季节？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"春季"},{"key":"B","text":"秋季"},{"key":"C","text":"夏季"},{"key":"D","text":"冬季"}],"answer":"B","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"秋季气温下降，动物迁徙，叶片枯黄。","verify":"\"秋季\""},{"id":"cns_p032_q7","topicId":"cns_p032","source":"textbook","type":"choice","prompt":"两次圆月之间大约相隔多长时间？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"一天"},{"key":"B","text":"一星期"},{"key":"C","text":"一个月"},{"key":"D","text":"一年"}],"answer":"C","difficulty":"standard","explanation":"月相的变化周期大约是一个农历月。","verify":"\"一个月\""},{"id":"cns_p032_q8","topicId":"cns_p032","source":"textbook","type":"short","prompt":"在天气炎热、雨水充足的（___）季，庄稼生长最快。","answer":"夏","difficulty":"standard","explanation":"夏季气温高、光照强，是植物生长的旺季。","verify":"夏"},{"id":"cns_p032_q9","topicId":"cns_p032","source":"textbook","type":"choice","prompt":"下列属于非生物的是：","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"小树"},{"key":"B","text":"蚂蚁"},{"key":"C","text":"小猫"},{"key":"D","text":"岩石"}],"answer":"D","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"岩石没有生命，属于非生物。","verify":"\"岩石\""},{"id":"cns_p032_q10","topicId":"cns_p032","source":"textbook","type":"choice","prompt":"天气预报说今天有大雪，小朋友应该穿：","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"厚棉袄"},{"key":"B","text":"短袖上衣"},{"key":"C","text":"裙子"},{"key":"D","text":"凉拖鞋"}],"answer":"A","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"下雪天气温低，需防寒保暖。","verify":"\"厚棉袄\""},{"id":"cns_p032_q11","topicId":"cns_p032","source":"textbook","type":"short","prompt":"当风力非常大，吹得树枝乱跳、行人难以行走，这种天气是（___）。","answer":"大风","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"这是对大风天气现象的描述。","verify":"大风"},{"id":"cns_p033_q5","topicId":"cns_p033","source":"textbook","type":"short","prompt":"大雨天气也会对人类的出行产生影响。","answer":"对","accept":["正确","√","T","true","是"],"difficulty":"basic","explanation":"天气与人类生活密切相关，恶劣天气会带来不便。","verify":"对"},{"id":"cns_p033_q6","topicId":"cns_p033","source":"textbook","type":"choice","prompt":"中午的时候，太阳在我们的哪个方向？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"东方"},{"key":"B","text":"南方"},{"key":"C","text":"西方"},{"key":"D","text":"北方"}],"answer":"B","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"在我国北回归线以北地区，中午太阳位于正南方。","verify":"\"南方\""},{"id":"cns_p033_q7","topicId":"cns_p033","source":"textbook","type":"choice","prompt":"傍晚，我们面对太阳时，背后是什么方向？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"南方"},{"key":"B","text":"西方"},{"key":"C","text":"东方"},{"key":"D","text":"北方"}],"answer":"C","difficulty":"standard","explanation":"傍晚太阳在西方，面对西方时背后是东方。","verify":"\"东方\""},{"id":"cns_p033_q8","topicId":"cns_p033","source":"textbook","type":"short","prompt":"空气看不见，所以它不属于地球家园的一部分。","answer":"错","accept":["错误","×","F","false","不是","不对"],"difficulty":"basic","explanation":"空气是地球家园非常重要的非生物部分。","verify":"错"},{"id":"cns_p033_q9","topicId":"cns_p033","source":"textbook","type":"choice","prompt":"傍晚时分，我们要去西方看日落，应该面向：","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"背对太阳"},{"key":"B","text":"左边是太阳"},{"key":"C","text":"右边是太阳"},{"key":"D","text":"正在落下的太阳"}],"answer":"D","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"日落在西方，面向落日即面向西方。","verify":"\"正在落下的太阳\""},{"id":"cns_p033_q10","topicId":"cns_p033","source":"textbook","type":"choice","prompt":"下列哪项不是土壤对植物的作用？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"制造阳光"},{"key":"B","text":"固定根部"},{"key":"C","text":"提供水分"},{"key":"D","text":"提供养料"}],"answer":"A","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"阳光来源于太阳，不是土壤制造的。","verify":"\"制造阳光\""},{"id":"cns_p033_q11","topicId":"cns_p033","source":"textbook","type":"short","prompt":"冬天天气寒冷，北方会降下白色的（___）。","answer":"雪","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"降雪是冬天的典型天气现象。","verify":"雪"},{"id":"cns_p034_q5","topicId":"cns_p034","source":"textbook","type":"short","prompt":"我们每天看到的月亮形状都是圆圆的。","answer":"错","accept":["错误","×","F","false","不是","不对"],"difficulty":"basic","explanation":"月相是不断变化的，只有在农历十五左右才是圆的。","verify":"错"},{"id":"cns_p034_q6","topicId":"cns_p034","source":"textbook","type":"choice","prompt":"在观察土壤里的动植物时，我们应该：","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"把动物带回家"},{"key":"B","text":"保持安静不惊扰"},{"key":"C","text":"直接拔掉植物"},{"key":"D","text":"随意去踩踏"}],"answer":"B","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"科学观察要尊重生命，尽量减少对环境的影响。","verify":"\"保持安静不惊扰\""},{"id":"cns_p034_q7","topicId":"cns_p034","source":"textbook","type":"choice","prompt":"青蛙在冬天会通过什么方式来度过寒冷？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"换毛"},{"key":"B","text":"迁徙"},{"key":"C","text":"冬眠"},{"key":"D","text":"储备粮食"}],"answer":"C","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"青蛙是冷血动物，冬天通过冬眠降低能量消耗。","verify":"\"冬眠\""},{"id":"cns_p034_q8","topicId":"cns_p034","source":"textbook","type":"short","prompt":"太阳在空中的位置是会变化的，我们的影子也会随之变化。","answer":"对","accept":["正确","√","T","true","是"],"difficulty":"basic","explanation":"影子的长度和方向随太阳高度和方位的变化而改变。","verify":"对"},{"id":"cns_p034_q9","topicId":"cns_p034","source":"textbook","type":"choice","prompt":"如果有雷电发生，我们不应该：","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"关好门窗"},{"key":"B","text":"在室内避雨"},{"key":"C","text":"关闭电源"},{"key":"D","text":"在大树下避雨"}],"answer":"D","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"大树易遭雷击，在树下避雨很危险。","verify":"\"在大树下避雨\""},{"id":"cns_p034_q10","topicId":"cns_p034","source":"textbook","type":"choice","prompt":"如果地球上没有了水，会发生什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"生命将无法生存"},{"key":"B","text":"草木长得更茂盛"},{"key":"C","text":"鱼儿游得更欢"},{"key":"D","text":"天气会变凉爽"}],"answer":"A","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"水是生命之源，没有水生命就会枯萎。","verify":"\"生命将无法生存\""},{"id":"cns_p034_q11","topicId":"cns_p034","source":"textbook","type":"short","prompt":"（___）是动植物共同的家园。","answer":"地球","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"地球提供了生物生存的所有基本条件。","verify":"地球"},{"id":"cns_p035_q5","topicId":"cns_p035","source":"textbook","type":"short","prompt":"为了建房子，我们可以随意砍伐身边的树木。","answer":"错","accept":["错误","×","F","false","不是","不对"],"difficulty":"basic","explanation":"我们要爱护自然资源，不能随意破坏生态环境。","verify":"错"},{"id":"cns_p035_q6","topicId":"cns_p035","source":"textbook","type":"choice","prompt":"下列哪种形状可能是我们在天空中看到的月亮？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"长方形"},{"key":"B","text":"镰刀形"},{"key":"C","text":"五角星形"},{"key":"D","text":"心形"}],"answer":"B","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"月相变化过程中会出现类似镰刀或眉毛的形状。","verify":"\"镰刀形\""},{"id":"cns_p035_q7","topicId":"cns_p035","source":"textbook","type":"numeric","prompt":"一年中一共有（___）个季节。","answer":"4","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"指春夏秋冬四季。","verify":"4"},{"id":"cns_p035_q8","topicId":"cns_p035","source":"textbook","type":"short","prompt":"强风、洪水等属于极端天气，会造成危害。","answer":"对","accept":["正确","√","T","true","是"],"difficulty":"basic","explanation":"极端天气对生命和财产具有破坏性。","verify":"对"},{"id":"cns_p035_q9","topicId":"cns_p035","source":"textbook","type":"choice","prompt":"下列哪种行为是动物为了适应冬季而做的准备？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"燕子飞回北方"},{"key":"B","text":"蝉大声鸣叫"},{"key":"C","text":"松鼠储存松果"},{"key":"D","text":"小狗换厚毛"}],"answer":"C","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"松鼠在秋季储存粮食以备冬月食用。","verify":"\"松鼠储存松果\""},{"id":"cns_p035_q10","topicId":"cns_p035","source":"textbook","type":"choice","prompt":"农民伯伯通常在哪个季节播种农作物的种子？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"夏季"},{"key":"B","text":"秋季"},{"key":"C","text":"冬季"},{"key":"D","text":"春季"}],"answer":"D","difficulty":"standard","explanation":"一年之计在于春，春季是播种的季节。","verify":"\"春季\""},{"id":"cns_p036_q5","topicId":"cns_p036","source":"textbook","type":"choice","prompt":"下列属于地球家园中的生物是：","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"路边的小草"},{"key":"B","text":"路边的岩石"},{"key":"C","text":"清澈的溪水"},{"key":"D","text":"洁白的云朵"}],"answer":"A","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"草具有生长、繁殖等生命特征，属于生物。","verify":"\"路边的小草\""},{"id":"cns_p036_q6","topicId":"cns_p036","source":"textbook","type":"choice","prompt":"下列哪种植物是在春天开花的？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"腊梅"},{"key":"B","text":"桃花"},{"key":"C","text":"菊花"},{"key":"D","text":"荷花"}],"answer":"B","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"桃树在春季回暖时进入花期。","verify":"\"桃花\""},{"id":"cns_p036_q7","topicId":"cns_p036","source":"textbook","type":"numeric","prompt":"我们通常说太阳每天在（___）点左右从东方升起（填整数）。","answer":"6","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"一般情况下晨昏线的平均时间基准为早晨6点。","verify":"6"},{"id":"cns_p036_q8","topicId":"cns_p036","source":"textbook","type":"short","prompt":"不同的季节里，我们的穿着是一样的。","answer":"错","accept":["错误","×","F","false","不是","不对"],"difficulty":"basic","explanation":"我们要根据季节变化调节着装，保暖或防暑。","verify":"错"},{"id":"cns_p036_q9","topicId":"cns_p036","source":"textbook","type":"choice","prompt":"下列哪个是人类爱护地球家园的表现？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"随意丢弃塑料袋"},{"key":"B","text":"大量使用农药"},{"key":"C","text":"垃圾分类回收"},{"key":"D","text":"捉鸟当宠物"}],"answer":"C","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"垃圾分类有助于资源利用和环境保护。","verify":"\"垃圾分类回收\""},{"id":"cns_p036_q10","topicId":"cns_p036","source":"textbook","type":"choice","prompt":"我们造房子的木材主要直接来自：","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"工厂"},{"key":"B","text":"矿山"},{"key":"C","text":"大海"},{"key":"D","text":"森林"}],"answer":"D","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"树木是森林的主要组成部分，提供木材资源。","verify":"\"森林\""},{"id":"cns_p037_q5","topicId":"cns_p037","source":"textbook","type":"choice","prompt":"早晨，太阳从哪个方向升起？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"东方"},{"key":"B","text":"南方"},{"key":"C","text":"西方"},{"key":"D","text":"北方"}],"answer":"A","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"太阳东升西落是地球自转产生的自然规律。","verify":"\"东方\""},{"id":"cns_p037_q6","topicId":"cns_p037","source":"textbook","type":"choice","prompt":"我们的衣服大多是用什么材料做成的？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"钢铁"},{"key":"B","text":"棉花或蚕丝"},{"key":"C","text":"岩石"},{"key":"D","text":"塑料"}],"answer":"B","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"棉花和蚕丝是来源于自然界的衣物原料。","verify":"\"棉花或蚕丝\""},{"id":"cns_p037_q7","topicId":"cns_p037","source":"textbook","type":"short","prompt":"地球家园中，表面覆盖着许多沙土和碎石的部分叫做（___）。","answer":"土壤","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"土壤是地球表面的疏松层。","verify":"土壤"},{"id":"cns_p037_q8","topicId":"cns_p037","source":"textbook","type":"short","prompt":"我们虽然看到的月亮形状不同，但月球本身不发光。","answer":"对","accept":["正确","√","T","true","是"],"difficulty":"standard","explanation":"月球反射的是太阳的光。","verify":"对"},{"id":"cns_p037_q9","topicId":"cns_p037","source":"textbook","type":"choice","prompt":"农历八月十五这一天，月相正圆，这一天被称为：","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"端午节"},{"key":"B","text":"春节"},{"key":"C","text":"中秋节"},{"key":"D","text":"重阳节"}],"answer":"C","difficulty":"standard","explanation":"农历八月十五是中秋佳节，此时月相最圆。","verify":"\"中秋节\""},{"id":"cns_p037_q10","topicId":"cns_p037","source":"textbook","type":"numeric","prompt":"月相变化一个周期（农历一个月）大约有（___）天。","answer":"30","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"农历月平均约为29.5天，整数约为30天。","verify":"30"},{"id":"cns_p038_q5","topicId":"cns_p038","source":"textbook","type":"short","prompt":"大山、森林和河流都属于自然世界中的景观。","answer":"对","accept":["正确","√","T","true","是"],"difficulty":"basic","explanation":"大山、森林和河流是自然形成的，不属于人工制造。","verify":"对"},{"id":"cns_p038_q6","topicId":"cns_p038","source":"textbook","type":"choice","prompt":"我们使用的教材封面主要是用（ ）做成的。","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"玻璃"},{"key":"B","text":"皮革"},{"key":"C","text":"橡胶"},{"key":"D","text":"纸"}],"answer":"D","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"书本的主要材料是纸。","verify":"\"纸\""},{"id":"cns_p038_q7","topicId":"cns_p038","source":"textbook","type":"choice","prompt":"筷子常用的材料比较多。下列材料中，导热最快的是（ ）。","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"不锈钢"},{"key":"B","text":"竹子"},{"key":"C","text":"木头"},{"key":"D","text":"塑料"}],"answer":"A","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"金属的导热性能优于木材和塑料。","verify":"\"不锈钢\""},{"id":"cns_p038_q8","topicId":"cns_p038","source":"textbook","type":"short","prompt":"木材是来自自然界的天然材料。","answer":"对","accept":["正确","√","T","true","是"],"difficulty":"basic","explanation":"木材直接取自树木，是天然材料。","verify":"对"},{"id":"cns_p038_q9","topicId":"cns_p038","source":"textbook","type":"choice","prompt":"普通的雨伞手柄通常用塑料制成，这主要是因为塑料（ ）。","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"很重"},{"key":"B","text":"手感舒适且轻便"},{"key":"C","text":"容易导电"},{"key":"D","text":"非常昂贵"}],"answer":"B","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"塑料手柄轻、不导热且易塑形。","verify":"\"手感舒适且轻便\""},{"id":"cns_p038_q10","topicId":"cns_p038","source":"textbook","type":"choice","prompt":"运动鞋的鞋带常用棉线，这是为了（ ）。","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"漂亮"},{"key":"B","text":"防水"},{"key":"C","text":"结实且易系紧"},{"key":"D","text":"增加重量"}],"answer":"C","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"棉线摩擦力适中，结合纤维强度适合做鞋带。","verify":"\"结实且易系紧\""},{"id":"cns_p039_q5","topicId":"cns_p039","source":"textbook","type":"short","prompt":"棉质毛巾摸起来非常坚硬、光滑。","answer":"错","accept":["错误","×","F","false","不是","不对"],"difficulty":"basic","explanation":"棉布材料的特性通常是柔软、吸水、粗糙。","verify":"错"},{"id":"cns_p039_q6","topicId":"cns_p039","source":"textbook","type":"choice","prompt":"相比于竹简，纸这种材料的优点是（ ）。","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"更笨重"},{"key":"B","text":"更容易刻字"},{"key":"C","text":"防蛀防腐烂"},{"key":"D","text":"轻便易携带"}],"answer":"D","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"纸克服了竹简笨重的缺陷。","verify":"\"轻便易携带\""},{"id":"cns_p039_q7","topicId":"cns_p039","source":"textbook","type":"choice","prompt":"保温杯的杯套通常是尼龙或硅胶做的，主要是为了（ ）。","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"防烫手"},{"key":"B","text":"装水多"},{"key":"C","text":"让杯子变轻"},{"key":"D","text":"变得更硬"}],"answer":"A","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"硅胶是热的不良导体，能起到防烫作用。","verify":"\"防烫手\""},{"id":"cns_p039_q8","topicId":"cns_p039","source":"textbook","type":"short","prompt":"金属材料具有反光能力。","answer":"对","accept":["正确","√","T","true","是"],"difficulty":"basic","explanation":"由于金属光泽，金属表面通常能反光。","verify":"对"},{"id":"cns_p039_q9","topicId":"cns_p039","source":"textbook","type":"choice","prompt":"我们在实验室用放大镜观察材料，发现木材表面往往有（ ）。","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"金属光泽"},{"key":"B","text":"花纹或年轮"},{"key":"C","text":"很多气泡"},{"key":"D","text":"透明的划痕"}],"answer":"B","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"年轮和木纹是天然木材的特征。","verify":"\"花纹或年轮\""},{"id":"cns_p039_q10","topicId":"cns_p039","source":"textbook","type":"numeric","prompt":"把两张同样的纸中的一张折成瓦楞纸，实验表明，同样负重下，平纸可能在放（ ）个垫圈时就弯曲了。","answer":"1","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"单张平纸支撑力极弱，一般1个垫圈就会使其变形。","verify":"1"},{"id":"cns_p040_q5","topicId":"cns_p040","source":"textbook","type":"short","prompt":"在古代，人们曾把字写在竹片上，这种书叫竹简。","answer":"对","accept":["正确","√","T","true","是"],"difficulty":"basic","explanation":"竹子是古代造纸术普及前重要的书写材料。","verify":"对"},{"id":"cns_p040_q6","topicId":"cns_p040","source":"textbook","type":"choice","prompt":"雨伞的伞面通常选用的材料是（ ）。","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"吸水的棉布"},{"key":"B","text":"厚重的木板"},{"key":"C","text":"不透水的塑料布"},{"key":"D","text":"容易生锈的铁片"}],"answer":"C","difficulty":"basic","explanation":"雨伞需要防水，塑料或防水布是最佳选择。","verify":"\"不透水的塑料布\""},{"id":"cns_p040_q7","topicId":"cns_p040","source":"textbook","type":"numeric","prompt":"在造纸术发明前，人们在竹片上刻字，一捆竹简写不了太多字。大约（ ）年前蔡伦改进了造纸术。","answer":"2000","difficulty":"standard","explanation":"蔡伦在公元105年前后改进造纸术，距今约两千年。","verify":"2000"},{"id":"cns_p040_q8","topicId":"cns_p040","source":"textbook","type":"short","prompt":"泥板书在古代书写起来非常轻便且容易保存。","answer"